Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Naruto joined the\NAkatsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:02.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Oh, fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Our boy saw matching villain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,cloaks and thought, career\Nopportunity. .
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Motherflicker, they are hunting\Nthe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:08.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,fox inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:10.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is not a job interview. You\Nare the lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:11.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this made up timeline,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,he bargains for his friend's\Nsafety. you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:14.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fine, but the cloak comes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.45,0:00:15.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,with suspiciously aggressive\Nmanagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:17.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pain calls it peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,village gets a demolition\Nnotice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.95,0:00:20.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naruto says, can we maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,try a conversation first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:26.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Obito, Maskon, Off,\Nexcellent hiring department.\NAnd...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:27.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,at first, missions go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:29.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Our boy finally feels respected.\Nyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then comes the assignment,\Nbetray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:31.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,the hidden leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:32.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Brother, that is your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:33.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,this stupid contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:35.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,He refuses, suddenly the new
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:36.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,team questions his loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:38.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sakura is left picking through\Nrubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.55,0:00:39.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some protection plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:40.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even his old friends cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:41.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,tell whose side he is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:43.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.71,0:00:45.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Two teams, Zero Trust, no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:46.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,dental insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,So he stops chasing approval
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,and chooses his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:50.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Akatsuki wanted a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:51.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,They got an argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:52.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Could he actually change them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:54.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is Naruto, But
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:56.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,friendship speeches cannot fix\Nevery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:57.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,murderous group project, Would\Nyou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,trust his plan, or confiscate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:00:59.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,the cloak immediately?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,Heading,,0,0,0,,BAD CAREER MOVE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.90,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE CLOAK IS A RED FLAG
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.90,0:00:08.13,Heading,,0,0,0,,YOU ARE THE TARGET
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.13,0:00:10.21,Heading,,0,0,0,,NOT AN INTERVIEW
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.21,0:00:13.11,Heading,,0,0,0,,A MADE-UP DEAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.11,0:00:16.09,Heading,,0,0,0,,SUSPICIOUS MANAGEMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.09,0:00:18.95,Heading,,0,0,0,,PEACE WITH A DEMOLITION NOTICE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.95,0:00:21.64,Heading,,0,0,0,,CAN WE TALK FIRST
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.64,0:00:26.07,Heading,,0,0,0,,ACCOUNTABILITY OFF
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.07,0:00:29.16,Heading,,0,0,0,,FINALLY SOME RESPECT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.16,0:00:31.37,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE REAL ASSIGNMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.71,Heading,,0,0,0,,READ THE CONTRACT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.71,0:00:36.63,Heading,,0,0,0,,HE REFUSES
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.63,0:00:39.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,SOME PROTECTION PLAN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.42,0:00:41.87,Heading,,0,0,0,,OLD FRIENDS, NEW DOUBTS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.87,0:00:46.58,Heading,,0,0,0,,TWO TEAMS. ZERO TRUST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.58,0:00:49.06,Heading,,0,0,0,,CHOOSE YOUR PEOPLE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.06,0:00:51.51,Heading,,0,0,0,,WEAPON OR ARGUMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.18,Heading,,0,0,0,,COULD HE CHANGE THEM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.18,0:00:57.22,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE GROUP PROJECT FROM HELL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.22,0:01:00.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,KEEP OR CONFISCATE THE CLOAK
